        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-24T15:24:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Cosmic Omnitron flips when components are/aren't currently in play, but since doing 7 points of damage will wipe out all components in one shot, I'm thinking of keeping our house rule that you only get to remove one component for each 7 points of damage the heroes do. &nbsp;Seems like it could be a bit easy, to have Cosmic Omnitron start with H-2 components out but then for them to go away all in one blast.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:10:16.475Z",
