        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-08-25T03:44:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Oh, the humanity! &nbsp;We just played against Bomber Blade with a collection of \"who are you in the mood to play tonight\" heroes and got our arses handed to us. So much damage, coming at you all the time! &nbsp;After our swift and ignoble defeat, we started over, this time with our \"A\" team of heroes and lost again, but just barely.&nbsp;</p><p>I'm definitely going to be changing this villain's rating in my oversized cards to a \"3\" instead of a \"2\". &nbsp;Digging it.&nbsp;</p>",
