        "created_at": "2012-08-25T18:53:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"ketigid\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> ketigid:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Bomber Blade is really easy on mars. Just hide in the meteor showers and charge up tachyon or bunker.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>With the new Mars, a good number of the villains are much easier, in my opinion. &nbsp;Regular Blade and Voss have alternate win conditions, so they are exempt, and some villains destroy environment cards. &nbsp;For the rest, hiding in the Meteor Storm is really easy, and you get to set up as much as you want while you wait for the right conditions. &nbsp;Since Pervasive Red Dust doesn't destroy all of your equipment anymore, things are much happier.</p>",
